{"body": "Premium and copay information for children who fall in the ALL Kids Low Fee and Fee groups is outlined below. Children in the No Fee group are not charged copayments or premiums. Please click these links for health and dental copay information:\n\n2026 Health Insurance Copays\n\n2026 Dental Insurance Copays", "citation_label": "ADPH ALL Kids: Premiums and Copays 1", "citation_path": "us-al/manual/adph/chip/premiums-and-copays/block-1", "document_class": "manual", "expression_date": "2026-01-01", "heading": "Premiums and Copays", "id": "745880c2-c2c2-506c-a0b2-1f377bcaa0c2", "jurisdiction": "us-al", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 3, "content_type": "text/html", "discovered_via": "manual-review:chip-agent-queue; publisher index confirmed by agent 2026-09-10", "document_subtype": "agency_eligibility_policy_page", "download_url": "https://www.alabamapublichealth.gov/allkids/premiums-and-copays.html", "kind": "block", "primary_source": true, "program": "CHIP", "source_authority": "Alabama Department of Public Health, ALL Kids", "source_discovery_group": "us-al/manual/chip", "source_url": "https://www.alabamapublichealth.gov/allkids/premiums-and-copays.html", "state_program": "ALL Kids", "title": "ADPH ALL Kids: Premiums and Copays"}, "ordinal": 1, "parent_citation_path": "us-al/manual/adph/chip/premiums-and-copays", "parent_id": "4013b941-45f5-50f0-a410-9bf774361bc1", "source_as_of": "2026-09-10", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "al-adph-allkids-premiums-and-copays", "source_path": "sources/us-al/manual/2026-09-10-chip-state-eligibility-manual/official-documents/al-adph-allkids-premiums-and-copays.html", "source_url": "https://www.alabamapublichealth.gov/allkids/premiums-and-copays.html", "version": "2026-09-10-chip-state-eligibility-manual"}
{"body": "Low Fee Group: $52.00 (Not to exceed $156 per family)\n\nFee Group: $104.00 (Not to exceed $312 per family)", "citation_label": "ADPH ALL Kids: Premiums and Copays 2", "citation_path": "us-al/manual/adph/chip/premiums-and-copays/block-2", "document_class": "manual", "expression_date": "2026-01-01", "heading": "Annual Premiums", "id": "9d935885-8506-5969-a8f3-3f1eb6e5037c", "jurisdiction": "us-al", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 3, "content_type": "text/html", "discovered_via": "manual-review:chip-agent-queue; publisher index confirmed by agent 2026-09-10", "document_subtype": "agency_eligibility_policy_page", "download_url": "https://www.alabamapublichealth.gov/allkids/premiums-and-copays.html", "kind": "block", "primary_source": true, "program": "CHIP", "source_authority": "Alabama Department of Public Health, ALL Kids", "source_discovery_group": "us-al/manual/chip", "source_url": "https://www.alabamapublichealth.gov/allkids/premiums-and-copays.html", "state_program": "ALL Kids", "title": "ADPH ALL Kids: Premiums and Copays"}, "ordinal": 2, "parent_citation_path": "us-al/manual/adph/chip/premiums-and-copays", "parent_id": "4013b941-45f5-50f0-a410-9bf774361bc1", "source_as_of": "2026-09-10", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "al-adph-allkids-premiums-and-copays", "source_path": "sources/us-al/manual/2026-09-10-chip-state-eligibility-manual/official-documents/al-adph-allkids-premiums-and-copays.html", "source_url": "https://www.alabamapublichealth.gov/allkids/premiums-and-copays.html", "version": "2026-09-10-chip-state-eligibility-manual"}
{"body": "Since June 1, 2012, families have not been required to pay more than 5% of their annual income (the income used to determine eligibility for ALL Kids) in out of pocket expenses (premiums and copayments) annually. It is the enrollee's family's responsibility to contact ALL Kids when they are close to reaching the out of pocket maximum. The family will be asked to submit receipts for these expenses.\n\nIf you have questions or would like to know your family's exact annual out of pocket maximum, please call Customer Service at 1-888-373-5437.\n\nPage last updated: April 16, 2026", "citation_label": "ADPH ALL Kids: Premiums and Copays 3", "citation_path": "us-al/manual/adph/chip/premiums-and-copays/block-3", "document_class": "manual", "expression_date": "2026-01-01", "heading": "Annual Out of Pocket Maximum", "id": "9da19ed7-aea7-5a5b-bdb1-cc3b6738cf20", "jurisdiction": "us-al", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 3, "content_type": "text/html", "discovered_via": "manual-review:chip-agent-queue; publisher index confirmed by agent 2026-09-10", "document_subtype": "agency_eligibility_policy_page", "download_url": "https://www.alabamapublichealth.gov/allkids/premiums-and-copays.html", "kind": "block", "primary_source": true, "program": "CHIP", "source_authority": "Alabama Department of Public Health, ALL Kids", "source_discovery_group": "us-al/manual/chip", "source_url": "https://www.alabamapublichealth.gov/allkids/premiums-and-copays.html", "state_program": "ALL Kids", "title": "ADPH ALL Kids: Premiums and Copays"}, "ordinal": 3, "parent_citation_path": "us-al/manual/adph/chip/premiums-and-copays", "parent_id": "4013b941-45f5-50f0-a410-9bf774361bc1", "source_as_of": "2026-09-10", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "al-adph-allkids-premiums-and-copays", "source_path": "sources/us-al/manual/2026-09-10-chip-state-eligibility-manual/official-documents/al-adph-allkids-premiums-and-copays.html", "source_url": "https://www.alabamapublichealth.gov/allkids/premiums-and-copays.html", "version": "2026-09-10-chip-state-eligibility-manual"}
